    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Crochet a chain of about 40 stitches in a matching yarn, then twist it on itself to form a coiled cord. Sew one end to the side of the telephone base and the other to the side of the handset. Embroider a circular dial on the face of the base with a "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "glossaryTooltip",
              "attrs": {
                "termSlug": "colour-change"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "colour change"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " centre. Rest the handset across the top of the base."
        }
      ]
    },
